# Boutique storefront templates + inspiration

When creating or refining a boutique storefront, read `docs/agent-handoffs/10-boutique-design-inspiration.md`.

## Official templates (standards)

| ID | Site | URL |
|----|------|-----|
| **standard1** / **template1** | Balmoral Running | https://www.balmoralrunning.com/ |
| **standard2** / **template2** | Cecilie Bahnsen | https://ceciliebahnsen.com/ |
| **standard3** / **template3** | Marine Layer | https://www.marinelayer.com/ |

- Numbers are **IDs only — not priority**. Do not prefer a lower number by default.
- Choose the template from **what the boutique sells** and brand vibe (or the ID the user names).
- Open the live template URL; apply layout/rhythm/chrome via boutique home/PDP registries.
- Do not copy assets, branding, or build a pixel clone.

## Inspiration accents (not full-site standards)

- Roberto Collina: PDP product display + model poses.
- Serotoninn: typography + model/type composition.
